[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2759993)[0m    - C is 0 (as expected).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=2759993)[0m    - From C, via B and D, we reach A and D. But D is not directly reachable from C in the graph (D->C is an edge, but C does not have an edge to D). So D is not reachable from C (C->A, not C->D).
